Hoàng Mai Mobile prioritizes product quality and customer rights, offering a comprehensive warranty policy to ensure customer confidence. This policy outlines the conditions for warranty, cases not covered, warranty durations for various product types, and details regarding warranty reception [Data: Sources (10, 18)].

**Conditions for Warranty Application**
Products are eligible for warranty if they meet specific criteria: the issue must be a technical fault originating from the manufacturer, the product must retain its original structure without alteration, it must be within the warranty period specified by Hoàng Mai Mobile, and the warranty stamp or seal must be intact, not torn, peeled, or replaced [Data: Sources (10, 18)].

**Cases Not Covered by Warranty**
Hoàng Mai Mobile will not accept warranty claims for products under certain circumstances. These include damage caused by incorrect usage, wrong voltage, incorrect technical specifications, or physical damage like drops or impacts. Products that have been tampered with or repaired by entities other than Hoàng Mai Mobile are also excluded. Additionally, products with missing, torn, faded, or counterfeit warranty stamps, those affected by water, short circuits, oxidation, or similar factors, and products that are deformed or do not retain their original shape and structure are not covered. Warranty claims are also rejected if the product is past the announced warranty period on the order or website [Data: Sources (10, 18)].

**Warranty Duration by Product Type**
The warranty period varies depending on the product category:
*   **Screens and Touchscreens**: All types of screens have a 6-month touch warranty (provided they still display, are not scratched or cracked, and have straight cables). Roger screens have a 6-month storage warranty, covering issues like detached bezels, air bubbles, unresponsive touch, flickering, image retention, and lines. Roger touchscreens have a 6-month warranty, but this does not apply if the cable is torn/broken, the glass is scratched, or if there is physical damage from drops [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
*   **Batteries**: iPhone batteries come with a 12-month warranty, while batteries for Samsung, Oppo, Vivo, Xiaomi, Nokia, Huawei, Vsmart, and iPad have a 6-month warranty. However, batteries are not covered if they swell after one month of use, have torn cables, are deformed, or have missing warranty stamps [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
*   **Components**: Charging cables, charging boards, power cables, and volume cables are warranted for 3 months if the seal is intact. Once the seal is removed, they are not covered [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
*   **Repair Equipment**:
    *   Hot air guns and soldering stations: 6 months for the main unit (soldering short circuit: 3 months) [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Microscopes and cameras: 6 months [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Boxes for screen/battery/FaceID repair, hard drive replacement: 6 months [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Mainboard separation heating plates: 6 months for the control unit [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Power supplies and multimeters: 6 months [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Power supply cables, battery activators: 1 month for the converter [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Laminating machines, autoclaves: 1 year [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Glass cutting machines, vacuum machines, OCA laminating machines, mini autoclaves: 6 months [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Glue removal machines, grinding machines, electric screwdrivers: 1 month [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Bezel removal machines, camera separation machines, cable separation machines: 3 months [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   USB chargers < 10 ports: 3 months [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Multi-port chargers (≥ 20 ports): 1 month [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    *   Technical lights, microscope lights: 1 month [Data: Sources (11, 19)].
    For other products, customers should refer to the product description on the website or consult staff [Data: Sources (11, 19)].

**Warranty Reception Time and Location**
Warranty claims are accepted daily from 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM, excluding holidays and Tet. The main warranty location is at Số 08, ngõ 117 Thái Hà, phường Trung Liệt, quận Đống Đa, Hà Nội. Customers can contact the hotline at 0982.15.3333 or 0911.160.388 for warranty support, or email hoangmaimobile.vn@gmail.com [Data: Sources (11, 19)].

**Important Notes**
The warranty policy may be subject to change. Customers are advised to check the latest announcements on the website www.hoangmaimobile.vn or contact Hoàng Mai Mobile directly for accurate support [Data: Sources (11, 19)]. Hoàng Mai Mobile is committed to providing the best service quality, competitive prices, excellent warranty, and a diverse range of quality products, specializing in wholesale and retail phone components, repair tools, and glass pressing materials [Data: Sources (11, 19)].


