Hoàng Mai Mobile provides a clear and flexible payment policy to ensure transparency and maximize customer benefits during the shopping process [Data: Sources (6)]. The company supports various payment methods, including cash payments both in-store and upon delivery, as well as online payments through VNPAY [Data: Sources (6, 29, 30)].

**Cash Payments**
Customers have two primary options for cash payments:
*   **Payment at the store:** Customers can visit the physical store located at Số 08 ngõ 117 phố Thái Hà, phường Trung Liệt, quận Đống Đa, thành phố Hà Nội, to select and pay for products in cash. Staff are available to assist with the payment process [Data: Sources (6, 4)]. The hotline for sales inquiries is 0982.15.3333, and technical support/warranty is available at 0911.160.388 [Data: Sources (6, 4)].
*   **Payment upon receipt (COD):** For customers ordering online via the website, fanpage, Zalo, or Shopee, Hoàng Mai Mobile offers cash on delivery. To use this method, customers must provide complete delivery information, including full name, phone number, email, province/city, district, ward/commune, street name, and specific address. The delivery personnel will bring the product to the specified address, and customers are required to pay in cash directly to the staff after inspecting the goods. This method is particularly suitable for those who wish to check the product before making payment [Data: Sources (6)].

**VNPAY Payments**
Hoàng Mai Mobile also facilitates online payments through the VNPAY gateway, a solution developed by Vietnam Payment Solution Joint Stock Company (VNPAY) [Data: Sources (29)]. VNPAY supports various payment options:
*   **VNPAY-QR via Mobile Banking apps and e-wallets:** Customers can use the QR Pay/VNPAY-QR feature integrated into over 35 Mobile Banking applications and more than 15 linked e-wallets. After selecting products and choosing VNPAY as the payment method, a QR code will be displayed with the amount due. Customers then use their banking app to scan the QR code. The QR code is valid for 15 minutes [Data: Sources (29, 30)].
*   **Domestic cards and bank accounts:** Customers can pay using over 40 domestic ATM/bank accounts. The process involves selecting "Thẻ nội địa và tài khoản ngân hàng" (Domestic cards and bank accounts) on the VNPAY gateway, entering card/account details, and then inputting an OTP sent to the registered phone number to complete the transaction. This transaction also has a 15-minute expiry [Data: Sources (29, 30)].
*   **International payment cards:** Payments can be made using 4 international payment cards (Visa, MasterCard, JCB, UnionPay), following a process similar to domestic card payments [Data: Sources (29, 30)].
*   **VNPAY e-wallet:** This method is similar to paying via VNPAY-QR [Data: Sources (30)].

Hoàng Mai Mobile commits to quick order confirmation, on-time delivery, providing 100% new and accurate products, and supporting exchanges/returns for technical faults according to company policy. Customer information is kept absolutely confidential in all transactions [Data: Sources (6)].


