HOÀNG MAI MOBILE specializes in a comprehensive range of products and services catering to mobile phone repair and electronics, operating as both a wholesale and retail supplier [Data: Reports (1, 6, 10, 12, 5, +more)].

The store offers a wide array of essential equipment for mobile repair, including soldering machines and stations, microscopes, power supply units, and various testing devices [Data: Reports (2, 8, 1, 7, 6, +more)]. Specialized machinery such as glass pressing machines, glue winding machines, heating equipment, Hot Air Rework Stations, Screen Laminating Machines, Heating Plates, Heating Tables, Grinding and Cutting Machines, and Lamps are also available [Data: Reports (2, 8, 7, 10, 5, 9, 4, +more)]. For precision work, they provide multi-port chargers, measuring instruments, knives, screwdrivers, phone disassembly tools, probes, and mainboard/phone clamps [Data: Reports (2, 8, 7, 10, 5, 9, 4, +more)].

In terms of spare parts and components, HOÀNG MAI MOBILE supplies a vast selection for various mobile phone brands. This includes screens (such as Roger screens), glass, touchscreens, and batteries compatible with iPhone, Samsung, Oppo, Vivo, Xiaomi, Nokia, Huawei, Vsmart, and iPad devices [Data: Reports (8, 7, 10, 1, 0, +more)]. They also stock cameras, charging ports, charging cables, charging boards, power cables, volume cables, speakers, microphones, SIM trays, phone frames, back covers, home buttons, power switches, camera glass, iPhone seals, waterproof seals, and phone casings [Data: Reports (8, 7, 10, 1, 0, 3, 4, +more)].

Furthermore, the company provides a comprehensive range of consumables and materials vital for mobile repair. This includes soldering materials like solder, paste, and rosin, along with cleaning solutions, various adhesives (glue, UV glue, tape), copper wire, and IC reballing stencils [Data: Reports (2, 8, 7, 10, 1, +more)].

Beyond products, HOÀNG MAI MOBILE offers extensive customer support and services. These include a customer loyalty program (effective from January 1, 2024), transparent policy frameworks for warranty, privacy, payments, delivery, and returns [Data: Reports (2, 8, 1, 7, 6, +more)]. They also engage customers through strategies like discounts and flash sales [Data: Reports (2, 8, 1, 7, 6, +more)]. Customers can utilize lookup services for order tracking and warranty status, and access dedicated customer support via a hotline [Data: Reports (2, 8, 9, 3, 4, +more)]. The store ensures efficient nationwide shipping and offers flexible payment methods, including cash, Cash on Delivery (COD), and online payments via VNPAY [Data: Reports (3)].


