Hoàng Mai Mobile provides a comprehensive warranty policy for its accessories and components, designed to ensure product quality while outlining clear conditions for service eligibility. Generally, products are covered if they exhibit technical faults from the manufacturer, remain in their original, unaltered state, and are within the specified warranty period with an intact warranty stamp [Data: Reports (0)]. Conversely, the warranty is voided by improper user handling, incorrect voltage, unauthorized repairs, missing or damaged warranty stamps, environmental damage (like water ingress or oxidation), physical deformation, or if the product has exceeded its warranty period [Data: Reports (0)].

Specific accessory categories have distinct warranty durations. Screens and touchscreens are typically covered for 6 months for touch functionality, provided the display remains fully functional, free from scratches or cracks, and has intact cables. Specialized "Màn hình Roger" (Roger screens) and Roger touchscreens also carry a 6-month warranty, specifically addressing manufacturing defects such as detached seals, air bubbles, unresponsive touch, flickering, image retention, or visible lines. However, this warranty is not applicable if the connecting cable is torn, the glass is scratched, or the unit has suffered physical damage from dropping or impact [Data: Reports (0)]. For batteries, iPhone batteries receive a 12-month warranty, while batteries for Android devices and tablets (including Samsung, Oppo, Vivo, Xiaomi, Nokia, Huawei, Vsmart, and iPad) are covered for 6 months. Battery warranties are voided if the battery swells after one month of use, or if there is physical damage such as a torn cable, deformation, or a missing warranty stamp [Data: Reports (0)].

For other essential internal components, such as charging cables, charging boards, power cables, and volume cables, Hoàng Mai Mobile offers a 3-month warranty. A crucial condition for these components is that the original seal must remain intact; removal or breakage of this seal will invalidate the warranty [Data: Reports (0)].

Customers seeking warranty service can do so daily from 10:00 AM to 6:00 PM, excluding public holidays and Tết. The primary location for warranty claims is at Hoàng Mai Mobile's headquarters: Số 08, ngõ 117 Thái Hà, phường Trung Liệt, quận Đống Đa, Hà Nội. For support, customers can contact the main hotline at 0982.15.3333, the dedicated warranty support line at 0911.160.388, or email hoangmaimobile.vn@gmail.com. It is important to note that the warranty policy may be subject to change, and customers are advised to check the official website or contact staff for the most current information [Data: Reports (0)].


