Hoàng Mai Mobile specializes in the retail supply of various products related to mobile phone repair and maintenance. Their retail offerings primarily include phone components, phone repair tools, and materials for phone screen pressing [Data: Sources (26)].

The range of phone components available for retail purchase is extensive, covering items such as SIM cards, backlights (phản quang), films, power cables, phone frames and chassis, back covers, home buttons and other buttons, volume cables, batteries, power switches, camera glass and bezels, iPhone gaskets, adhesive seals, waterproof gaskets, cameras, speakers, microphones and mic cables, SIM trays, screens, glass, touchscreens, charging board assemblies, charging ports, and phone casings [Data: Sources (1, 3, 6, 12, 20, +more)].

For phone repair tools, Hoàng Mai Mobile offers a comprehensive selection. This includes multi-port chargers, multimeters and probes, solder, solder paste, flux, various solutions and cleaning agents, knives and knife handles, screwdrivers and bits, disassembly tools, grinding and cutting machines with accessories, lamps, mainboard and phone clamps, rubber, different types of adhesives (including UV glue) and tape, forceps, tweezers, pliers, seals, clips, screws, copper wire, cutting wire, and reballing stencils [Data: Sources (1, 3, 6, 12, 20, +more)]. Additionally, they provide specialized equipment such as hot air guns and accessories, soldering stations and accessories, microscopes and accessories, power supplies and accessories, test boxes, test fixtures, cables, heating plates, and heating tables [Data: Sources (3, 12, 20, 27, 31)].

Regarding materials and equipment for phone screen pressing, customers can find glass molds, gasket molds, molds and bases for IC reballing, OCA glue, screen pressing machines and their accessories, and glue rolling machines and their accessories [Data: Sources (1, 3, 6, 12, 20, +more)].


